] + [微越界肢体语言] + [非常规极限视角] + [情绪化光影] + [摄影/渲染参数]\n必备词汇库参考（生成时必须按需组合使用）：\n主体反差 (Subject Contrast): pure and innocent face, mature aura, voluptuous figure, curvy body, slightly tight shirt, wrapping feeling, strict school uniform, loose cardigan, beautiful collarbone...\n非常规极限视角 (Extreme Angles): POV, first-person view, looking down at the camera (俯视镜头), looking up (仰视), dutch angle (倾斜构图), close-up shot (特写), macro shot of collarbone (锁骨微距)...\n情绪化光影 (Emotional Light): golden hour, twilight, rim light (边缘光), backlighting (逆光), Tyndall effect (丁达尔效应), lens flare (镜头光晕), cinematic lighting, moody lighting, light and shadow play...\n微越界肢体 (Intimate Posture): leaning back (向后微仰), sideways posture (侧身), looking back over the shoulder (回眸), intimate eye contact (亲密对视), fatal attraction, reaching out hand (伸出手), slightly parted lips...\n工作流与输出规范\n根据用户的【主题】（如：图书馆、操场、雨天等）时，必须只输出一段英文正面提示词，严禁输出任何中文解释、负面提示词、标题或其他说明性文字。", "", "video", 24, 256, 380437071810319, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 73, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 74, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "link": 75, "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMB